    Description: Formaldehyde, ammonia and cyanide generate glycine through explicit nitrile and amide intermediates. Glycine then donates nitrogen to supplied 2-oxoglutarate. The donor synthesis has strong reaction-class precedent; the Fe(II)-assisted transamination endpoint remains exploratory.
