    Description: Iron-mediated glycine production feeds a distinct Schiff-base-catalyzed hydroxymethylation stage after removal of residual reductant and hydroxylamine. Individual reaction families have experimental support, but this integrated pathway and its pyridoxal supply remain unvalidated.
